OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Rangers player Kyle Hutton
OL,4,Ato stand trial over road death
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Rangers player Kyle Hutton is to
OL,7,Fstand trial in 2028 accused of killing
OL,8,Fa woman in a road collision.
OL,10,FHutton is said to have been "unfit to
OL,11,Fdrive through alcohol or drugs" when he
OL,12,Fallegedly struck Victoria Cairns, 40,
OL,13,Fin Farmeloan Road, Rutherglen, South
OL,14,FLanarkshire, on 2 November 2024.
OL,16,FThe 35-year-old denies the charges,
OL,17,Fwhich include going at excessive speed
OL,18,Ffor the conditions at the time and not
OL,19,Fseeing the pedestrian.
OL,21,FCairns died from her injuries in
OL,22,Fhospital four days later.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
